# Supro environment (Vite + Cloudflare Pages Functions)
#
# CRITICAL: use a NEW Supabase Organization + Project for Supro Auth.
#   Do NOT reuse the Letus IELTS org (confirm-email redirects would hit IELTS).
#   Do NOT migrate Letus users — fresh signup only.
# SQL: apply supabase/supro.sql in the NEW project's SQL Editor.
# Archive: supabase/supro_on_letus.sql is Letus-era only.
#
# Gold: GOLD_PER_USD = 100 (100 gold = $1). MIN_GOLD_FLOOR = 20 for 苏坡大模型.
# Admin: seanfudan@163.com gets ≥100000 gold via SQL ensure_supro_economy.
# Weekly ranks / bakes do NOT use LLM tokens.
# Only 苏坡大模型 / Fin Desk calls DeepSeek (Pages secret LLM_API_KEY — never commit).

## Vite (browser — anon only)
VITE_BASE=/
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_NEW_SUPRO_PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supro_anon_key

## Cloudflare Pages Function secrets (dashboard / wrangler pages secret put)
# SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_NEW_SUPRO_PROJECT.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# LLM_BACKEND=deepseek
# LLM_API_KEY=
# LLM_MODEL=deepseek-chat
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
# IWENCAI_API_KEY=   (bake only; never to browser; zero LLM)

## GitHub Actions
# CF_API_TOKEN=
# CF_ACCOUNT_ID=
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_NEW_SUPRO_PROJECT.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# IWENCAI_API_KEY=

## Supabase Dashboard (owner — NEW Supro org/project)
# Auth → Enable email confirmations (disable autoconfirm)
# Auth → Site URL: https://supro.si
# Auth → Redirect URLs: https://supro.si/** , https://www.supro.si/** , Pages preview
# Optional: App Metadata { "role": "admin" } on seanfudan@163.com
# SQL editor: supabase/supro.sql
